  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "TCP: Obvious Retransmissions are marked as Out-of-Order",
  "description": "Some packets were reluctant to be correctly identified as\nRetransmissions while they are preceded by identical packets with\nthe same sequence number and length.\nIn addition to the sequence numbers checks, we now also check if\nthere are similar packets waiting to be acknowledged, meaning they\nare Retransmissions.\n\nFixes #13284 #13843\nSee #13863.",
