      "title": "TCP: Obvious Retransmissions are marked as Out-of-Order",
      "message": "TCP: Obvious Retransmissions are marked as Out-of-Order\n\nSome packets were reluctant to be correctly identified as\nRetransmissions while they are preceded by similar packets with\nthe same sequence number and length.\nIn addition to the sequence numbers checks, we now also check if\nthere are similar packets waiting to be acknowledged, meaning they\nare Retransmissions.\nFix #13284 #13843\nSee #13863.\n",
